cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scatac-calib in a publication, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "scatac-calib: calibration-aware evaluation for scATAC-seq sequence models"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-12"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A command-line framework that separates sequence-derived signal from
  frequency- and depth-driven baseline performance in scATAC-seq
  sequence-to-accessibility models. It reports frequency-null AUROC,
  group-level oracle AUROC, delta AUROC with paired bootstrap confidence
  intervals, depth-matched AUROC, and a minimum reporting checklist.
keywords:
  - scATAC-seq
  - chromatin accessibility
  - benchmark
  - calibration
  - AUROC
authors:
  - name: "Wheat scATAC Benchmark Team"
    affiliation: "Henan Agricultural University, Zhengzhou, China"
